{"title":"Tuesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/969152447/0/marginalrevolution~Tuesday-assorted-links.html","date":1789488801000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/DavidRBellamy/status/2099187370407112758\" target=\"_blank\">Easy to bioengineer a very dangerous virus?</a></p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.10181\" target=\"_blank\">The astrophysicists are getting antsy too</a>.  Princeton <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/GregoryConti19/status/2098886966184214535\" target=\"_blank\">is also getting nervous</a>.  If nothing else, these are huge PR own goals.  The guy is a Mill scholars, can you imagine J.S. Mill tweeting that way?</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEqQi52_F8ag\" target=\"_blank\">New David Brooks podcast</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/kyleichan/status/2099089779660825005?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">One Chinese view of AI risk</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.richardhanania.com/p/why-is-china-not-freaking-out-about?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=98102&amp;post_id=214586328&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjo0NzYxLCJwb3N0X2lkIjoyMTQ1ODYzMjgsImlhdCI6MTc4OTM4MTUwNSwiZXhwIjoxNzkxOTczNTA1LCJpc3MiOiJwdWItOTgxMDIiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.nPsPnvhfviL4UKbZ_E3NmE2npkOk2k2dcoKL49fwm_s&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">from Richard Hanania</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/polanyi-knowledge-and-ai?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=338673&amp;post_id=215489145&amp;